WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
A small ship, tossed in a storm.

2
00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:07.700
On the island nearby, a robed
figure stands and watches.

3
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:11.340
Twelve years ago, his
brother stole his dukedom.

4
00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.700
Now his enemies are
washed up on his shore.

5
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:19.030
Then he turns to his spirit servant
and says there's more work to do.

6
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.380
Twelve years of wrongs, and the
whole play takes one afternoon.

7
00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:26.210
So how can it all be settled so fast?

8
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:29.140
In this mission, you'll
map the play's five acts,

9
00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.160
from the storm onwards.

10
00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:35.180
You'll check the play's clock: how
long does all this really take?

11
00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:39.080
And you'll follow the groups of
survivors as they wander the island.

12
00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:44.280
Your mission: work out how twelve years
of wrongs are settled in one afternoon.
